                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a serious D2C launch cost?</h3>
                                        <p>₹40 lakh - 1.5 Cr excluding inventory + first 6 months of marketing. Under-investing here compounds into slow scaling.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I launch on Shopify or build custom?</h3>
                                        <p>Shopify Plus for 95% of launches. Custom only if you have specific reasons (complex configurator, unique subscription mechanics).</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need PR at launch?</h3>
                                        <p>For premium / editorial-aligned brands, yes. For mass-market D2C, PR is often less impactful than creator seeding.</p>
                                        <h3>How long before I know if my launch is working?</h3>
                                        <p>First indicators in month 2-3 (CVR, first repeat rate, CAC). Confidence in month 4-6.</p>
